{
  "comment": "The Prism's coherence: every facet as one high-definition model with typed ports, and the flow that binds them into one runtime, after verdant resonance's MetaModel interface/composition elements and its functor bus. tools/coherence/gen.py checks the flow (every port produced and consumed, every root facet live or sealed by PrismHost, every place fed, every act and setting driven) and writes site/coherence/coherence.mjs, which the page runs on. Each facet is kept in its own file under facets/ (read by tools/specs/record.py), so parallel changes never collide.",
